- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives one unambiguous usage total covering every provider call in the turn; rounds without usage contribute nothing, and a turn where no provider call reports usage receives no usage ([validated by: reports the usage from every provider call across two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/usageAggregation.acceptance.test.ts#L40), [validated by: counts reported rounds without producing undefined or NaN when usage is absent](../../src/orchestration/usageAggregation.acceptance.test.ts#L59)).
